@TaskMarket_HostAddress = http://localhost:5292
# Paste the "token" returned by /api/Accounts/Login here
@token =

### Public endpoints
GET {{TaskMarket_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{TaskMarket_HostAddress}}/api/Contractor/GetBestContractors?count=5
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{TaskMarket_HostAddress}}/api/Accounts/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer_0@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123!"
}

### Authenticated (Customer role)
POST {{TaskMarket_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "title": "Fix the kitchen sink",
  "description": "Leaking pipe under the sink",
  "address": "12 Main St"
}

###
GET {{TaskMarket_HostAddress}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

